    <task id="LOCAL-00007" summary="Add result saving, adjustable confidence thresholds, and onboarding tips&#10;&#10;- Implement &quot;Save Result&quot; to export annotated bitmaps to the device gallery using MediaStore.&#10;- Add UI controls to dynamically adjust the confidence threshold in `LiveDetectionActivity`.&#10;- Introduce a first-run onboarding popup to guide users through the application's features.&#10;- Enhance the report slideshow with manual navigation dots and pause/resume functionality.&#10;- Update `AndroidManifest.xml` with storage permissions for legacy Android versions.&#10;- Refine layouts for `MainActivity` and `LiveDetectionActivity` to accommodate new action buttons.">
